                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;5.3.8 (2026-03-19)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a bug where &lt;code&gt;MaxDequeueCount&lt;/code&gt; was being applied to messages in the poison queue itself, leading to poison messages being silently skipped and left unprocessed indefinitely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
