&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a bug where &lt;code&gt;MaxDequeueCount&lt;/code&gt; was being applied to messages in the poison queue itself, leading to poison messages being silently skipped and unprocessed indefinitely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
