                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Microsoft.Azure.WebJobs.Extensions.Storage.Blobs_5.3.8"&gt;Microsoft.Azure.WebJobs.Extensions.Storage.Blobs_5.3.8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
