                                &lt;h2&gt;5.3.8 (2026-03-19)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a bug where polling for new blobs could permanently miss blobs that were created or modified while a multi-request blob listing scan was in progress (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3197167229" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/issues/51030" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/issues/51030/hovercard" href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/issues/51030"&gt;#51030&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bug fix ensuring that BlobTrigger log scan targets the correct storage account in multi-account scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
